---
/** Story: Afghanistan — every figure is computed from the current snapshot at build time. */
import DocPage from '../DocPage.astro';
import { localizePath, type Locale } from '../../../i18n/ui';
import { getCountry, getInsights, getSources } from '../../../lib/data-server';
import { fmtInt } from '../../../lib/format';
import { metricAt, peak, firstReported, latestReported } from './story-utils';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh-Hant' || locale === 'zh-Hans';
const afg = getCountry('AFG');
const irn = getCountry('IRN');
const pak = getCountry('PAK');
const src = getSources()?.['unhcr_population'];
const n = (v: number | null | undefined) =>
  v === null || v === undefined ? '—' : fmtInt(v, locale);
const first = afg ? firstReported(afg, 'origin', 'refugees') : null;
const refPeak = afg ? peak(afg, 'origin', 'refugees') : null;
const refNow = afg ? latestReported(afg, 'origin', 'refugees') : null;
const ref2021 = afg ? metricAt(afg, 'origin', 'refugees', 2021) : null;
const retPeak = afg ? peak(afg, 'origin', 'returned_refugees') : null;
const retNow = afg ? latestReported(afg, 'origin', 'returned_refugees') : null;
const idpNow = afg ? latestReported(afg, 'asylum', 'idps') : null;
const irnPeak = irn ? peak(irn, 'asylum', 'refugees') : null;
const pakPeak = pak ? peak(pak, 'asylum', 'refugees') : null;
const topYears = getInsights()?.records?.top_origin_years.find((r) => r.iso3 === 'AFG')?.years;
const mapLink = (q: string) => `${localizePath('/', locale)}${q}`;
---

<DocPage
  locale={locale}
  ogImage="/og/story/afghanistan.jpg"
  title={zh ? '阿富汗：四十六年，尚未結束' : 'Afghanistan: forty-six years, and counting'}
  lede={zh
    ? '這份資料集裡，沒有任何國家像阿富汗一樣：自 1979 年起，累計數十年位居全球最大難民來源國——而 2025 年的故事，是規模空前的回返與遣返。'
    : 'No country in this dataset compares: since 1979 Afghanistan has spent decades as the world’s largest origin of refugees — and the 2025 story is returns and deportations on an unprecedented scale.'}
>
  <h2>{zh ? '一條從 1979 年開始的線' : 'A line that begins in 1979'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          UNHCR 對阿富汗籍難民的第一筆記錄出現在 <strong>{first?.year}</strong> 年：
          <strong>{n(first?.value)}</strong> 人——蘇聯入侵的那一年。此後的 75 年資料中，阿富汗有{' '}
          <strong>{topYears ?? '—'}</strong> 年位居全球最大來源國，比任何國家都久。峰值出現在{' '}
          {refPeak?.year} 年：<strong>{n(refPeak?.value)}</strong> 人。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          UNHCR's first record of Afghan refugees appears in <strong>{first?.year}</strong>:{' '}
          <strong>{n(first?.value)}</strong> people — the year of the Soviet invasion. Across the 75
          years of data, Afghanistan has spent <strong>{topYears ?? '—'}</strong> years as the
          world's largest origin — longer than any other country. The peak came in {refPeak?.year}:{' '}
          <strong>{n(refPeak?.value)}</strong>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={mapLink(`?m=refugees&v=origin&c=AFG&y=${refPeak?.year ?? 2023}`)}
      >{zh ? '在地圖上檢視 →' : 'See it on the map →'}</a
    >
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '承擔最多的是鄰國' : 'The neighbours carried most of it'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          阿富汗人絕大多數逃往兩個鄰國。伊朗的收容量在 {irnPeak?.year} 年達到{' '}
          <strong>{n(irnPeak?.value)}</strong> 人、巴基斯坦在 {pakPeak?.year} 年達到{' '}
          <strong>{n(pakPeak?.value)}</strong>
          ——這兩個峰值至今仍是全球收容史的最前列。庇護，主要是鄰國之間的事。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Most Afghans fled to two neighbours. Iran's hosting peaked in {irnPeak?.year} at{' '}
          <strong>{n(irnPeak?.value)}</strong>; Pakistan's in {pakPeak?.year} at{' '}
          <strong>{n(pakPeak?.value)}</strong> — both still among the largest hosting figures ever
          recorded. Asylum is, above all, something neighbours do.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={mapLink(`?m=refugees&c=IRN&y=${irnPeak?.year ?? 1991}`)}
      >{zh ? `在地圖上檢視伊朗 ${irnPeak?.year} 年 →` : `See Iran in ${irnPeak?.year} →`}</a
    >
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '2025 年：回返，與遣返' : '2025: returns — and deportations'}</h2>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          回返的最大單年紀錄長期是 {retPeak?.year} 年的 <strong>{n(retPeak?.value)}</strong>{' '}
          人。而最新資料（{retNow?.year} 年）記錄了 <strong>{n(retNow?.value)}</strong>{' '}
          名回返者——幾乎追平歷史紀錄。回返不必然出於自願：這一年的數字包含大規模遣返。與此同時，阿富汗境內仍有{' '}
          <strong>{n(idpNow?.value)}</strong> 名境內流離失所者，境外仍有{' '}
          <strong>{n(refNow?.value)}</strong> 名難民（2021 年為 {n(ref2021)}）。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          The largest return year had long been {retPeak?.year}, with{' '}
          <strong>{n(retPeak?.value)}</strong> people. The latest data ({retNow?.year}) records{' '}
          <strong>{n(retNow?.value)}</strong> returnees — nearly matching that record. Return is not
          necessarily voluntary: this year's figure includes large-scale deportations. Meanwhile{' '}
          <strong>{n(idpNow?.value)}</strong> people remain displaced inside Afghanistan, and{' '}
          <strong>{n(refNow?.value)}</strong> remain refugees abroad ({n(ref2021)} in 2021).
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={mapLink(`?m=returned_refugees&v=origin&c=AFG&y=${retNow?.year ?? 2025}`)}
      >{zh ? '在地圖上檢視回返 →' : 'See returns on the map →'}</a
    >
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '這些數字從哪裡來' : 'Where these numbers come from'}</h2>
  <p class="small muted">
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          本頁每個數字都在建置時由本站發布的資料計算而得（來源：{src?.attribution ?? 'UNHCR'}
          ，資料截至 {src?.data_as_of ?? '—'}
          ），不由編輯手寫，會隨每次資料更新自動修正。定義與注意事項見
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>方法論</a>；完整序列見
          <a href={localizePath('/country/AFG', locale)}>阿富汗國家頁</a>。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Every figure on this page is computed at build time from the data this site publishes
          (source: {src?.attribution ?? 'UNHCR'}, data as of {src?.data_as_of ?? '—'}) — never
          hand-written, and corrected automatically with every data update. Definitions and caveats:{' '}
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>methodology</a>; the full series:{' '}
          <a href={localizePath('/country/AFG', locale)}>the Afghanistan country page</a>.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
</DocPage>
